msgstr "&Gore"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "Plugin-ovi"

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Vrijednost"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Here you can see a list of the netscape plugins KDE has found."
msgstr "Ovdje možete vidjeti listu netscape plugin-a koje je KDE pronašao."

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "Use &artsdsp to pipe plugin sound through aRts"
msgstr "Koristi &artsdsp kako bi koristili aRts za zvukove plugina"

#: control/nsconfig.cpp:138
msgid ""
"Do you want to apply your changes before the scan? Otherwise the changes "
"will be lost."
msgstr ""
"Želite li primjeniti promjene prije provjere? Promjene će biti izgubljene "
"inače."

#: control/nsconfig.cpp:147
msgid "Scanning for plugins"
msgstr "Tražim plugin-e"

#: control/nsconfig.cpp:155
msgid ""
"The nspluginscan executable can't be found. Netscape plugins won't be "
"scanned."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu pronaći nspluginscan izvršnu datoteku. Pretraga ne može biti "
"izvršena."

#: control/nsconfig.cpp:193
msgid ""
"<h1>Netscape Plugins</h1>"
" The Konqueror web browser can use netscape plugins to show special content, "
"just like the Navigator does. Please note that how you have to install "
"netscape plugins may depend on your distribution. A typical place to install "
"them is for example '/opt/netscape/plugins'."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Netscape plugin-ovi</h1> Konqueror web preglednik može koristiti "
"netscape-ove plugin-e za prikaz određenih sadržaja, baš kao što to i "
"Navigator radi. Molim upamtite da instalacija netscape plugin-a može "
"uticati na rad vaše distribucije. Uobičajeno mjesto za instalaciju plugina "
"je npr. '/opt/netscape/plugins'."

